  <!--
    No FrameworkReference: neither test class names an ASP.NET type. The format gallery is a
    reflection walk over DateFormattingExtensions, and the architecture tests read the
    assembly. DebugController is exercised by DebugPageRenderTests in Humans.Integration.Tests
    (Cantina's rule — take the reference because a test names one, not because the section is
    Sdk.Razor).

    No exclusion from tests/Directory.Build.props' TestDbContextFactory compile item either,
    unlike Humans.Scanner.Tests / Humans.Cantina.Tests: Debug owns no tables but does
    reference Humans.Infrastructure for QueryStatistics / TrackingMemoryCache /
    InMemoryLogSink, so Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore is on the compile path and the shared
    fixture builds.
  -->

</Project>
